{"id":"vod_sn_36835","vodId":"36835","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"恋爱情结","name_cn":"恋爱情结","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/8708b787f307e70e27145fba645ff8a0.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在大阪的舞户学园，小泉理沙（冈村明美 配音）是一个身高170的“女巨人”，经常因为身高而被嘲笑的她在潜移默化之中担负起了搞笑的重任。无巧不成书，和理沙相对应的，同校的大谷敦士（永田彬 配音）是一个个头只有156的“矮冬瓜”，这一高一矮的两人不是冤家不聚头，在一 唱一和中，居然称为了校园之中的著名搞笑组合。　　其实理沙和大谷之间的感情并不坏，两人甚至还有着共同的爱好——均是“海坊主”的粉丝。在出双入对的同时，他们的距离也越来越近，在好友石原信子（东纱织 配音）和中尾平吉（津田健次郎 配音）的撮合下，终成眷属，一段校园爱情佳话成为传奇。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:46:31","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Pu32dGxNp11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BKAfLaQ9LS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/K65SDtGhRk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TDCXtMA8JM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bSL7y4h4VA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/C2aMK9sTDC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/S5ByGr1jS21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sQQxH2P1301/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/beaQSshDuv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qdJKT2ZN5x1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BMG7akP6w41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/guApMkHDBH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XTCZpyNEAu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CEm5kMZuxZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https:/